	"description": "Look at the silhouette and guess the country or region!\nWorld Map Silhouette Quiz is a quiz game that lets you enjoy learning world geography in a fun and accessible way.\n\nUse the shapes on screen as clues and discover the fun of recognizing countries from their outlines. As you play, you will naturally become more familiar with the world map, making it a great choice for learning, casual solo play, or quiz time with family and friends.\n\nPerfect for players who enjoy geography, quiz games, and educational challenges.\nTest your knowledge and see how many places around the world you can identify!\n\nSome map and silhouette representations in this game may be simplified for gameplay purposes.",
